{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Quacker Bros : First Heist",
    "steam_appid": 3103830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/ec403785d2e8ade6cc9d91ad9f401177.avif?t=1739507974\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br>Your ducks have worked tirelessly to amass a fortune in gold and diamonds, but their hard-earned treasure has caught the eye of a ruthless chicken gang. These feathered fiends are on a mission to plunder your wealth and decimate your duck army.<br><br>With addictive gameplay, endless challenges, and a touch of feathered fun, Quacker Bros offers hours of entertainment for strategy enthusiasts and casual gamers alike.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/50b8e962d164df8f1bb03bab2219521f.poster.avif?t=1739507974\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/50b8e962d164df8f1bb03bab2219521f.webm?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/50b8e962d164df8f1bb03bab2219521f.mp4?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It's time to quack back! Upgrade your ducks, unlock new and powerful units, and fortify your defenses to withstand the increasing ferocity of the chicken onslaught.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/48aa2dfbbdfd9d9e0d5f4a52f9e4c3d0.poster.avif?t=1739507974\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/48aa2dfbbdfd9d9e0d5f4a52f9e4c3d0.webm?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/48aa2dfbbdfd9d9e0d5f4a52f9e4c3d0.mp4?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Build and command an unstoppable force of ducks, each with unique abilities. Strategically deploy your troops to protect your bounty from wave after wave of chicken invaders. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/99841919eefb32cde20b148479f6d6b9.poster.avif?t=1739507974\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/99841919eefb32cde20b148479f6d6b9.webm?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/99841919eefb32cde20b148479f6d6b9.mp4?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>But beware! </strong> The chickens are cunning and relentless. They'll hatch new tactics and stronger birds to challenge your defenses. Can you outsmart these feathered foes and secure your fortune? Only the most strategic and fearless duck commander will prevail.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/ec403785d2e8ade6cc9d91ad9f401177.avif?t=1739507974\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br>Your ducks have worked tirelessly to amass a fortune in gold and diamonds, but their hard-earned treasure has caught the eye of a ruthless chicken gang. These feathered fiends are on a mission to plunder your wealth and decimate your duck army.<br><br>With addictive gameplay, endless challenges, and a touch of feathered fun, Quacker Bros offers hours of entertainment for strategy enthusiasts and casual gamers alike.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/50b8e962d164df8f1bb03bab2219521f.poster.avif?t=1739507974\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/50b8e962d164df8f1bb03bab2219521f.webm?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/50b8e962d164df8f1bb03bab2219521f.mp4?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It's time to quack back! Upgrade your ducks, unlock new and powerful units, and fortify your defenses to withstand the increasing ferocity of the chicken onslaught.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/48aa2dfbbdfd9d9e0d5f4a52f9e4c3d0.poster.avif?t=1739507974\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/48aa2dfbbdfd9d9e0d5f4a52f9e4c3d0.webm?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/48aa2dfbbdfd9d9e0d5f4a52f9e4c3d0.mp4?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Build and command an unstoppable force of ducks, each with unique abilities. Strategically deploy your troops to protect your bounty from wave after wave of chicken invaders. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/99841919eefb32cde20b148479f6d6b9.poster.avif?t=1739507974\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/99841919eefb32cde20b148479f6d6b9.webm?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103830/extras/99841919eefb32cde20b148479f6d6b9.mp4?t=1739507974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>But beware! </strong> The chickens are cunning and relentless. They'll hatch new tactics and stronger birds to challenge your defenses. Can you outsmart these feathered foes and secure your fortune? Only the most strategic and fearless duck commander will prevail.",
